打开不存在的文件（"r"）会 run-time error，所以先检查。<code>os.path.exists()</code> 返回 <b>Boolean</b>：存在 True，否则 False。<pre>import os
if os.path.exists("targetfile.txt"):
    print("The file exists.")
else:
    print("The file does not exist.")</pre>

步骤：readlines() → replace 去 \n → split(",") 成 2D list → 数字字段用 int() 转换（读入的都是 <b>string</b>）。<pre>f = open("fruits.csv", "r")
fruits = f.readlines()
f.close()
for i in range(0, len(fruits)):
    fruits[i] = fruits[i].replace("\n", "")
    fruits[i] = fruits[i].split(",")
for i in range(0, len(fruits)):
    for j in range(1, 3):
        fruits[i][j] = int(fruits[i][j])</pre>

删除前先检查存在，避免 run-time error：<pre>import os
if os.path.exists("targetfile.txt"):
    os.remove("targetfile.txt")
    print("File deleted")
else:
    print("The file does not exist")</pre>

